    "answer": {
      "short": "$t=20$",
      "worked": "Using the complementary-angle relationship:\n$$\\begin{align*}(2t+5)+(3t-15)&=90\\\\5t-10&=90\\\\5t&=100\\\\t&=20\\end{align*}$$",
